title: $:/plugins/btheado/notebook-kit/examples

\procedure examples() $:/plugins/btheado/notebook-kit/examples/

\procedure open-extracted-examples() <$action-listops $tiddler="$:/StoryList" $subfilter="[removeprefix<examples>!regexp[\]]"/>

Click the links to view `<$notebook-kit/>` widget examples:

<ul>
<$list filter="[all[shadows+tiddlers]] :filter[removeprefix<examples>!regexp[/]]" variable="src">
<$list filter="[<src>removeprefix<examples>]" variable="dst">
<li><$link to=<<src>>><<dst>></$link></li>
</$list>
</$list>
</ul>

Click the button below to "explode" the example notebook tiddlers into your wiki. These extracted
notebooks uses the full [[notebook story template|$:/plugins/btheado/notebook-kit/ui/NotebookStoryTemplate]]

<$button actions={{$:/plugins/btheado/notebook-kit/actions/extract-examples}}>
Extract notebooks from plugin
</$button>

<%if [all[shadows+tiddlers]removeprefix<examples>!regexp[/]is[tiddler]] %>
View extracted notebooks
<ul>
<$list filter="[all[shadows+tiddlers]removeprefix<examples>!regexp[/]]">
<li><$link/></li>
</$list>
</ul>
<%endif%>
